02:32.750 --> 02:34.410
Pulanglah dan tidur di rumah.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.400
Bangunlah.

02:49.910 --> 02:50.750
Pak Li.

02:52.000 --> 02:53.460
Kenapa kamu tidur di sini?

02:55.590 --> 02:56.500
Lembur sampai larut,

02:56.500 --> 02:58.700
